        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer CL4030-6, 6\" Single Acting Spring Hinge with Classic Ball Tips</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges plus #12 x 1-1/4\" wood  screws and 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws .  Fits 4-1/2\" template screw hole pattern for use on metal or wood  doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUL Listed For Fire Rated Door Applications. 4-1/2\" template hole pattern (Standard 4-1/2\" Mortise ANSI K81071F). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available with out Ball Tips: <a href=\"/products/6-inch-spring-hinge-ul-fire-rated-pair-bommer-4030-6\"><b>Bommer 4030-6 6\" Spring Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer spring hinges are certified Grade 1 (highest grade) for 1 million cycles and made in the USA. For wood or metal doors 1-3/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for the Bommer CL4030-6 6\" Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .134</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>4-1/2\" Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Factory Set Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Classic Ball Tips</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed For Fire Rated Door Applications (\"A\" label openings)</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81071F</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CL4030-6.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer CL4030-6 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer CL4030-6 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>CL4030-6</td>\r\n<td>125 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>155 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-3/4\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\"><span class=\"text\">Bommer Hinges made in the USA</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 4010 -->\r\n\r\n<p><b>* These hinges are normally special order 3-5 weeks to ship.</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b> Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>",
